            }, {
              "attributes" : {
                "imageInfos" : "",
                "richTextValue" : "<h3>\uD83E\uDDED <strong>Tailored Relocation Services Built Around Your Team</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>Whether it’s one key hire or a full-scale department move, we provide flexible relocation programs tailored to your company’s needs.</p><ul><li>Customized mobility programs</li><li>Domestic &amp; international support</li><li>Cost-effective corporate solutions</li></ul><hr><h3>\uD83D\uDD11 <strong>Complete Relocation Support – From Door to Desk</strong></h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Family in new home (caption: \"Home Search &amp; Temporary Housing\")</li><li>Movers unpacking boxes (caption: \"Packing &amp; Logistics\")</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><hr><h3>\uD83C\uDF0D <strong>Global Reach, Local Expertise</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>No matter where business takes your team, our experienced relocation consultants are ready to support them — locally and globally.</p><ul><li>24/7 Relocation Assistance</li><li>Cultural Integration &amp; Area Tours</li><li>Language &amp; Orientation Services</li></ul><hr><h3>\uD83E\uDD1D <strong>Why Companies Trust Us</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>With years of experience and a people-first approach, we make relocation simple, strategic, and stress-free.</p><p>✔ Trusted by Fortune 500s and startups</p><p>✔ Personalized relocation strategies</p><p>✔ Scalable programs for growing businesses</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><hr><h3>\uD83D\uDCDE <strong>Let’s Get Moving Together</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>Start building a better relocation experience today.</p>"
              },
              "definition" : "community_builder:richTextEditor",
              "id" : "688e6cb9-e3cd-4de4-b3bc-9765d597623a",
              "type" : "component"
            } ],
